msgstr "Light logo (for the transparent header)"

msgid "Una versión blanca o clara del logo, que se lea sobre la foto. Si no la cargás, se usa el logo de siempre."
msgstr "A white or light version of the logo that reads over the photo. If you don't upload one, the regular logo is used."

